expression: text
---
Anomalies found by the analysis. Open ones by default.

Usage: hn anomalies [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  show  One anomaly with explanation and values

Options:
      --all           Also closed ones
      --sensor <ID>   Only this sensor
      --since <TIME>  Only since (7d, 2026-11-01, …)
  -h, --help          Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn anomalies
  hn anomalies --all --since 30d
  hn anomalies show <id>
